      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like im just a part of a machine or something. every day is exactly the same. i wake up, go to the warehouse, scan stuff, move stuff, come home, sleep, and do it again. i dont even feel like a person anymore, just a gear that's gonna get replaced the second it stops turning. it feels like there's no point to any of it.",
